ers\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> e\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> value to analyze\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">e</span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">e</span></code> and <code><i>eof</i></code> value are not equivalent, or some other non-eof value otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/char_traits/eof\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>eof</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[static]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns an <i>eof</i> value <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public static member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/char_traits","title":"std::char_traits"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::char_traits<char>::not_eof, std::char_traits<wchar_t>::not_eof, std::char_traits<char8_t>::not_eof, std::char_traits<char16_t>::not_eof, std::char_traits<char32_t>::not_eof","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Given e, produces a suitable value that is not equivalent to eof."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"e"},{"label":"Return value","note":"e if e and eof value are not equivalent, or some other non-eof value otherwise."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"eof","note":"returns an eof value"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":91,"codeBlockCount":